# Infragistics strong-name public key, as the raw public key blob in hex.
#
# This is public data embedded in every assembly. It is pinned here so signing with a different key
# fails the release instead of silently establishing a new binary identity.
#
# Public key token: 7dd5c3163f2cd0cb
# Re-derive with: sn -Tp <any shipped Infragistics assembly>

